e statistics and frequencies were calculated by year to assess trends in demographic characteristics\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"nucleic acid test (NAT) results for the period 2014–2017 were used\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}